# The estate root is a Docker build context for two images that reach a
# sibling repo by relative path and so cannot build from one repo alone:
#
#   consumer/infra/docker-build/Dockerfile   consumer/ + office/packages/
#   consumer/relay/Dockerfile.docs           consumer/relay + the portal's marketing kit
#
# What must never enter a context, wherever it sits in the estate. Mirrors
# consumer/.dockerignore, which only applied while consumer/ was the context.
.git
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next-verify
**/build
**/dist
**/release
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
private/
